description	"Heavy Stormtrooper 

A slow, but heavily armed soldier specializing in suppression and area denial.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- SE-14C Blaster Pistol (2)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- 10% less Kb Taken
- Stamina (0)
- Armor Regen: 1/.5s to 20

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"